r/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"d36761","default":false,"description":"Indicates than the issue relates to something that worked in a previous version"},{"id":375501288,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU1MDEyODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20core","name":"area: core","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to the framework runtime"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2017-03-02T15:58:15Z","updated_at":"2019-09-10T23:22:29Z","closed_at":"2017-03-07T01:08:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The plunker says it all: https://plnkr.co/edit/eDNXO0iNeiG1InnSvSqQ?p=preview\r\n\r\nBefore it was possible to call `Renderer.createText(...)` from a listener registered via `Renderer.listen(...)` but from 4.0.0-rc.1 it blows with an error as seen in the linked plunker.\r\n\r\nThe error is thrown in the debug mode only - production mode is not affected. Seems like there is some shared state related to debug info and something is not initialized / cleaned up properly.\r\n\r\nI fully recognize that this is a corner case but it was [reported against ng-bootstrap](https://github.com/ng-bootstrap/ng-bootstrap/issues/1338) for the real-life use-case (we are using similar code in tooltips / popovers). I can work-around it on my side but again, this is an accidental breaking change and IMO one worth fixing if possible.","closed_by":{"login":"chuckjaz","id":372013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjAxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz","html_url":"https://github.com/chuckjaz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chuckjaz/followers","following_u